{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Counter-Plan 是一款將多種個人管理功能合而為一的智能工具，特別適合需要整理日常進度、記錄重要日期或進行宗教祈禱計數的用戶。這款原本定價 US $1.99 的應用現在提供限時免費下載，讓你能夠在一處集中處理倒數、正數、截止日期提醒及塔斯比赫（Tasbih）數字記錄，省去切換多個 App 的不便。</p>\n\n<h2>多功能個人進度管理</h2>\n<p>此應用核心在於其直覺化的分頁設計，涵蓋倒數與正數模式，方便記錄學習頁面或運動次數並附帶時間戳記。Deadline 功能可自動計算剩餘天數，無需手動更新。此外，內建的數據收集模組允許儲存開始與結束日期及備註，配合專用的塔斯比赫計數器，實現從習慣養成到靈修記錄的全面覆蓋，介面簡潔且操作流暢。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-129-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-130-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-131-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-132-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-133-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-134-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Counter-Plan-todo-tasbih-count</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-09T06:19:27.435653+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":377,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}